    "title": "Marriott hotel proposed for Floridian Town Center advances - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Teresa Sargeant ,\n10 hours ago A 137-room, four-story Marriott-branded hotel is proposed for Apopka's Floridian Town Center on 2.9 acres near Southfork Drive. The hotel project is under review and could be presented to the Planning Commission on May 12 and City Commission on June 3. Floridian Town Center is a 65-acre mixed-use development with... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
